  "comments": "<p>Mintmasters' initials are featured on the coin reverse. These initials are not included on coins minted after 2007. In 2001, there was a short period when there was no acting director for the mint. A small part of this year's mintage features a star to the right of the former director's initials.<br><br><i>Reverse</i><br>Two main groups of reverse are known.<br>Die <strong>A </strong>- tops of hammer and pick in mintmark with wedges.<br>Die<strong> B</strong> - tops of hammer and pick in mintmark without wedges.<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6196400398e37.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6196400398e37.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br><i>Combinations</i><br><strong>A</strong>: 1994-1998.<br><strong>B</strong>: 2000-2003, 2005, 2007-2009.<br><br>Some catalogues incorrectly include a mintage for the year 1999; such coin does not exist.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1994 blister set mintage of 10.000 included in normal circulation line.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Brilliant Uncirculated coin (1998-2007) was issued in the mint package.</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/678dc7ec5bbdd.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/678dc7ec5bbdd.jpg\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/678dc7f206dbf.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/678dc7f206dbf.jpg\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Brilliant Uncirculated coin (2007-2009) was issued in special mint set.</p>",
